h96-desktop (8.0.0~r8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Packaged files moved out of /usr/local and /opt: commands to /usr/bin
    and /usr/sbin, helpers and payloads to /usr/lib/h96, data to
    /usr/share/h96, units to /usr/lib/systemd/system, udev rules to
    /usr/lib/udev/rules.d; every reference rewritten. Fresh install over
    an image that holds the old copies moves exact old copies aside and
    deletes them at configure; a failed install restores them.
  * Manual pages for each command; Documentation key on each unit.
  * h96-kde-configure: kwin_x11 wrapper and libmali ld.so.conf diversions
    removed (no vendor blob).
  * h96-dm-handoff reads package install time with dpkg-query.
  * GNOME Settings desktop entry diverts
    /usr/share/applications/org.gnome.Settings.desktop.

